---
description: Visual, layout, and responsive work
globs:
  - "src/components/**/*.astro"
  - "src/styles/**/*.css"
  - "src/pages/**/*.astro"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Read `docs/project/DESIGN.md` and the relevant page plan before editing.
- Respect each reference file's declared `useFor` and `doNotUseFor`.
- Use semantic Tailwind theme tokens and utilities.
- Modify `src/styles/globals.css` only for shared project-wide decisions.
- Do not create a rigid card or section library.
- Design mobile-first and transform by content capacity.
- Check long text, media stability, targets, focus, overflow, and reduced motion.
- Inspect the real rendered page at mobile and desktop.
